    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken to me, ye that follow after righteousness, ye that seek the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": look unto the rock",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "whence",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye are hewn, and to the hole of the pit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "whence",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye are digged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look unto Abraham your father, and unto Sarah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bare you: for I called him alone, and blessed him, and increased him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall comfort Zion: he will comfort all her waste places; and he will make her wilderness like Eden, and her desert like the garden of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; joy and gladness shall be found therein, thanksgiving, and the voice of melody.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Hearken unto me, my people; and give ear unto me, O my nation: for a law shall proceed from me, and I will make my judgment to rest for a light of the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My righteousness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "near; my salvation is gone forth, and mine arms shall judge the people; the isles shall wait upon me, and on mine arm shall they trust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lift up your eyes to the heavens, and look upon the earth beneath: for the heavens shall vanish away like smoke, and the earth shall wax old like a garment, and they that dwell therein shall die in like manner: but my salvation shall be for ever, and my righteousness shall not be abolished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Hearken unto me, ye that know righteousness, the people in whose heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my law; fear ye not the reproach of men, neither be ye afraid of their revilings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the moth shall eat them up like a garment, and the worm shall eat them like wool: but my righteousness shall be for ever, and my salvation from generation to generation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Awake, awake, put on strength, O arm of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; awake, as in the ancient days, in the generations of old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou not it that hath cut Rahab,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wounded the dragon?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou not it which hath dried the sea, the waters of the great deep; that hath made the depths of the sea a way for the ransomed to pass over?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore the redeemed of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall return, and come with singing unto Zion; and everlasting joy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon their head: they shall obtain gladness and joy;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sorrow and mourning shall flee away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that comforteth you: who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou, that thou shouldest be afraid of a man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall die, and of the son of man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be made",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grass;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And forgettest the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy maker, that hath stretched forth the heavens, and laid the foundations of the earth; and hast feared continually every day because of the fury of the oppressor, as if he were ready to destroy? and where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.51.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the fury of the oppressor?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The captive exile hasteneth that he may be loosed, and that he should not die in the pit, nor that his bread should fail.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
